ent-ActionProperKungFuWolfDance = Wolf Dance
    .desc = Leap feet first in a straight flying kick into a target up to 5 tiles away. The kick knocks them down and sends them flying, and you land on the floor after it. A held shield blocks the kick but gets knocked out of the hands. Right after a Claw Series the kick hits much harder and sends the target further, but only knocks them down. Right after a Claw Whirlwind the flying kick is faster and the target flies 5 tiles.
ent-ActionProperKungFuClawWhirlwind = Claw Whirlwind
    .desc = Throw a target within fist reach over yourself and meet their jaw with your knee (10 Blunt to the torso, broken skull, brain trauma). They slowly spin up into the air and crash down. The target can't move for about 2 seconds. Shields don't help. A Wolf Dance within 2 seconds becomes a single fast dash that sends the target 5 tiles away, but you fall too. Right after a Wolf Grip it becomes a two-handed cross strike instead of the throw.
ent-ActionProperKungFuHammer = Hammer
    .desc = One sweeping downward claw strike into the head of a target within fist reach (15 Blunt, eyes and brain lose 30%). The target is floored and can't get up for 5 seconds. A target that was already lying takes 50 Blunt to the head and falls asleep for 30 seconds. A target in critical condition has its head torn to pieces. Right after a Wolf Grip it deals 20 Blunt to the head and you backflip away, and a Wolf Dance within 2 seconds becomes an instant dash into the target.
